[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5265421074","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122329#issuecomment-5265421074","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122329","id":5265421074,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOdfzEg","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T10:20:53Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T10:23:11Z","body":"One thing I'm not 100% sure about is that this would prevent people from removing the default options of Node2D, Node3D and Control. This can be a problem because the one you most likely want are your favorites which might quickly become too much down the page so you have to scroll to select it.\r\nI think maybe they should be removed when you have favorites as you can just add those nodes as favorite if you would prefer keeping them? In addition this would better allow you to choose where they are positioned.\r\n\r\nEdit : An image for reference of how favorites can quickly get hidden \r\n<img width=\"433\" height=\"873\" alt=\"Capture d’écran 2026-08-12 à 12 22 26\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90992da6-f0b3-4289-8491-24d2a3210349\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5265421074/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5268741614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122329#issuecomment-5268741614","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122329","id":5268741614,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOgqd7g","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T15:15:48Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T15:22:24Z","body":"@KoBeWi (cc. @ajreckof) I have a small issue with the current presentation of the PR. While I agree with the solution of removing the favorite \"tab\", I think that having favorites under a \"Favorites:\" subtitle goes against the subtitle (with the same size) above that says: \"Create Root Node\".\r\n\r\nHere's my suggestion:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"471\" height=\"399\" alt=\"Favorite create root\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ae514f3-4f7f-439b-8bc0-27a0e4a30d70\" />\r\n\r\nIt takes less space, and it shows clearly with a star on the right that the added elements are there because they were added being a favorite. (We could even make the star clickable if needed to unfavorite (and remove from the list))\r\n\r\nIt also makes favorites to show before the end of the list (with + Other Node, and Paste from Clipboard).\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5268741614/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5269931388","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122329#issuecomment-5269931388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122329","id":5269931388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOhzFfA","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/